9-4251-a356-234f8dc30a24","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/linuxfoundation/status/1372623843425148929?s=19|https://twitter.com/linuxfoundation/status/1372623843425148929?s=19\u003e","ts":"1616115678.095800","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/linuxfoundation|@linuxfoundation\u003e: Tux Turns 30! Join us as we celebrate 30 Years of Linux with social media contests, event celebrations \u0026amp; more, PLUS the April launch of the LF Online Store where you can shop all the 30th Anniversary gear. Start celebrating now: \u003chttps://bit.ly/3s7pDkx\u003e #TuxTurns30 #30YearsofLinux \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwyKHBOWEAY0Kec.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"The Linux Foundation","author_subname":"@linuxfoundation","author_link":"https://twitter.com/linuxfoundation/status/1372623843425148929","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/701834470807064576/Qkr8CTpm_normal.png","text":"Tux Turns 30! Join us as we celebrate 30 Years of Linux with social media contests, event celebrations \u0026amp; more, PLUS the April launch of the LF Online Store where you can shop all the 30th Anniversary gear. Start celebrating now: \u003chttps://bit.ly/3s7pDkx\u003e #TuxTurns30 #30YearsofLinux \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwyKHBOWEAY0Kec.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwyKHBOWEAY0Kec.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1616094001,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/linuxfoundation/status/1372623843425148929?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/linuxfoundation/status/1372623843425148929?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o1IkL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ac1dd36-4500-4431-aa0f-3b6154cd4c0e","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"boot: 300MB, rescue: 2GB(非常用ISOイメージ置き場), swap: 適宜, root: 残り全部\nって感じで分けてます\nrootの中はbtrfs subvolumeで適宜仮想パーティション(/, /home, /var/cache, etc…)に切り分けてますね","ts":"1616114750.095400","edited":{"user":"U81LLJ340","ts":"1616114898.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sP7K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a41c8fd-2fa1-45c8-b660-d6946f048b0a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"homeは簡単に汚れるので日付ディレクトリをスクリプトで掘ってbindしてる","ts":"1616114281.092500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"77vB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71e9e972-948c-4686-a6ef-6259db6d41b7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"FHSに従う気などないため/dataに振ってる","ts":"1616114178.091600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IQD1K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d95ad0c-cf5d-44ba-8fdb-b28bd9a17fe4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"homeは分離してないけど代わりにデータパーティションがある","ts":"1616114154.091100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bg=d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bc1762b-4e1f-468e-8084-043a3eccd719","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"/boot: 512MB, /: 64GB, /home: 残り全部って感じで分けてます。\n/を64GBにするとdockerのファイルで溢れるので、それは$HOMEの下に再配置してます。(再パーティションは面倒でやってない)","ts":"1616113698.090200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qYZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dc00ce1-a108-4bce-a643-debf514747d4","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私はhome分けない派ですね。/と/bootだけ","ts":"1616113446.090000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A1a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13381931-49c2-43e0-aa6d-750cc37460bf","type":"message","user":"U01HXNSLCH5","text":"homeって256GのssdをフルでLinuxインストールする場合どんなサイズにしてますか？","ts":"1616113201.088600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xI=PJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5b79c3b-e14a-4f11-8eec-b52b38c5a922","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁ使うなら `/` と `/boot` と `/home` で分けた方が再インストールしやすいとかありそうです。\n今はこのパーティションでセットアップしてます。","ts":"1616106199.087400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e6D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f653a27a-ea0c-47a8-8ef0-be5a761526f0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"manjaroはarchのパーティション作成とかがないから取っ掛かりとしては最高だと思う","ts":"1616105225.086900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IQBL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"727f3f0e-4018-46f3-9e84-730ab5cf616e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"使ったことないから一度使ってみたい","ts":"1616105197.086200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mKK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"003b8184-5596-4875-ad56-d36aeb16dc1c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"確かLinusはfedoraでしたっけ","ts":"1616105188.085900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OhR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7599d99-f57e-410a-a59e-258098f44f8f","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"compizは昔一度やったんですが当時の雑魚ノートPCでは気持ち重くてやめました、軽さを求めてOS変えている人は使わなくなってしまうのではないかと思います","ts":"1616095663.085000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N10"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f68bb631-3d7a-4430-bd84-a889aa929ef6","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":":turtle:で前の話題若干攫ってしまうんですけど、多分manjaroのzshの設定はaurのパッケージになっていて抜けば普通のzshとほぼ同じになるかと(zsh-completion等)","ts":"1616095142.076700","edited":{"user":"U01BY3SDBRS","ts":"1616095348.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UNJ2DANJC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mDW+h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad330e5f-